<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Morton downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Morton downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it reduced the rating on Morton International Inc to market outperform from the recommended list.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Kimberly Ritrievi was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/4 to 31-5/8.</p>
</text>
